    {
      "q": "Do you offer 24/7 emergency service?",
      "a": "Yes, emergency dispatch is available around the clock. Routine appointments follow regular hours."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does the diagnostic fee cover?",
      "a": "The technician visit and diagnosis. Any repair is quoted before work starts."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you service commercial properties?",
      "a": "Yes, residential and commercial."
    },
    {
      "q": "How often should a furnace be tuned up?",
      "a": "Once a year, before heating season."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can you tell me what's wrong with my system?",
      "a": "I can't diagnose it by phone. A technician will."
    },
    {
      "q": "What areas do you serve?",
